  "notes": "Small fixes from the YKW Elm live run of 1.6.2: the DW recording line names the cameras (name + IP) instead of list numbers; last-footage times are shown in local time (were UTC, 5 h off); camera clocks behind a DW server are read from the fresh Find-cameras list without a login; cameras whose model is not in the firmware reference list are one summary line; \"Restart the camera\" only for cameras that still have a network link and never \"Put the camera back on the NVR\" on a DW server; the DW session is always logged out at the end (also after an error) and one DW login is shared by the whole run; Find cameras says to press Cancel on the firewall prompt and run the Toolkit installer once as admin. Includes all 1.6.1/1.6.2 fixes.",
